# chained cross-lib — the THIRD library (a plain total boolean, no cross-lib operand of its own)
library "Third".

concept "Third Cond":
- type is Condition.
- shape is RecordSet.
- coded from "Third VS".

concept "Third Flag":
- type is Condition.
- value type is boolean.
- defined as exists ( "Third Cond" ).

terminology "Third VS":
- valueset is `urn:third-vs`.

activity "Third Refer":
- request CPGServiceRequest.

decision "Third Triage":
- when "Third Flag" then recommend activity "Third Refer".
